This repository contains ports of, and test data from, other projects:

- The Hippogriff reference implementation (Owen Lynch; Apache-2.0): the
  core (src/heff/{syntax,value,eval,conversion,readback,rename,serial,
  globals,memoed,params,print}.hf), the elaborator
  (src/heff/{top,rules,clauses,unify,environment}.hf) and the
  evaluator (src/heff/interp.hf) are ports of its modules; the programs of
  test/programs and test/errors are its golden tests, translated.
- fnotation (MPL-2.0): src/heff/notation.hf is from it and stays under
  MPL-2.0.
- diagnostician (Apache-2.0 OR MIT): the diagnostic format in
  src/heff/diagnostic.hf follows it.
- prettyprinter (BSD-2-Clause): lib/doc.hf reimplements its layout
  algorithm.

No license has been chosen yet for the rest of this repository.
